5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose moving desks. My mornings are tight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should check the billing basis first. The budget hasn't grown, but our footprint has.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to ensure no one is stuck with the noisy corner by default.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is invisible on a map. I need to see the sound meter readings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I care about who sits next to whom. That defines our daily connection.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the billing is high, does that mean we have to move faster?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Not necessarily. It means we need a layout that minimizes recurring setup costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the sound is bad, we need a rotation plan, not a fixed spot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,A rotation plan ignores the body's need for consistency. I will check the physio note.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, rotation breaks the trust we build. I want to see the staff survey.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the arrival times. I need to know when the room is actually empty.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will investigate the facilities quote. I need to know the cost of re-running power.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the unplanned seat shuffles. I need to see how often we break the pattern.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look into the sound meter readings. I need to know the decibel levels at each desk.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look into the drawn plan against the staff survey. I need to see what people actually want.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
