35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The badge records show a split arrival. If we move desks, half of us are already working.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The billing is per square meter, not per person. We are paying for empty space.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The shuffles were chaotic. We need a rule that prevents that from happening again.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The sound is nine decibels higher by the printer. My chair needs days to settle.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The survey says people want windows, but the joiners learned by listening. We need both.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we pay for empty space, can we shrink the footprint to save time?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Yes. A tighter layout reduces the area we bill for. It also cuts the re-run costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the sound is bad, we must rotate the noisy seats. No one should own the bad spot.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, rotation resets my ergonomic adjustments. I need a stable, quiet zone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, stability kills the organic learning the new joiners described. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I need a layout that lets me grab my bag and go without waiting for a chair.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"I need a layout that is cheap to maintain. Every move costs 6,200 yen.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I need a layout where the bad seats are shared. No permanent hierarchy of comfort.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,I need a layout where the quiet zone is fixed. My body needs that consistency.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I need a layout where the center is open. That is where the team actually talks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
