60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is a disaster for my schedule. I cannot hunt for a desk every morning.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option C is the only one that stops the 6,200 yen re-run fees. It is the only stable choice.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Option B is the only one that prevents the bad seats from becoming permanent. It is fair.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C is the only one that lets my chair settle. The others are chaos.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Option A is the only one that lets us talk. The joiners learned by overhearing, not by sitting still.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if C is stable, does it mean I have to sit in the same spot for years?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Yes. But it means we stop paying for changes. The budget is flat; we cannot afford movement.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, stability is not the same as fairness. If C is fixed, who gets the window?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, the window is quiet. That is the point. I need the quiet.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, if you take the quiet, the center becomes a dead zone. We lose the team.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I will vote for B. It is the only one that lets me keep my routine but still move.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for C. It is the only one that respects the budget. We cannot keep moving.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will vote for B. It is the only one that shares the burden of the bad seats.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I will vote for C. It is the only one that respects the body. I need the quiet.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I will vote for A. It is the only one that keeps us connected. We are a team, not a row of chairs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
